        "created_at": "2017-03-06T02:00:50.000Z",
        "cooked": "<p>The result should have been that Fixer dealt each non-hero target a base of two damage (plus buffs on each target) to each non-hero targets plus buffs and then would only get one trigger off of Dual Crowbars. &nbsp; You can read an example of this in the Fireside Chats more neatly organized here&nbsp;http://sentinelswiki.com/index.php?title=Clarifications#Shenanigans</p>",
