        "created_at": "2017-03-06T02:53:48.000Z",
        "cooked": "<p>You are correct Pydro I do not see any edit &nbsp;&nbsp;</p><p><span>Catch A Ride only gives you options on targets hit by Jack Handle as it takes the initial hit and converts it to hitting all non-hero targets. &nbsp; With Dual Crowbars it should only care about the first target so if you take out the first target then Sky-Scraper's attack won't occur. &nbsp;</span></p>",
