        "raw": "I don't see a problem with that\r\n\r\nI also don't see how that's true. You're still dealing damage. It's a second instance of damage, caused by the same initial effect, but it's still a new instance of damage. There are no simultaneous​ actions in game, so I don't see why \"Sky-Scraper deals one Target dealt damage this way\" doesn't apply to Crowbars.",
